npcRoles.Aetherhaven_Druid.name=Rowan Mossweald
profession=Druid
speaker=Rowan Mossweald
hub=A little patience makes a very good gardener.
quest.title=A Garden of Quiet Wonders
quest.description=Build Rowan a conservatory to cultivate plants for alchemy.
quest.objective.token=Collect the conservatory plot token from Rowan.
quest.objective.build=Build the conservatory.
quest.objective.talk=Return to Rowan.
bye=See you later.
how=Tell me about your work.
offer=Would you like to tend a conservatory here?
finish=The conservatory is ready.
progress=About your conservatory...
accept=Let us build it.
later=Perhaps later.
offer.body=There is more to a garden than supper. Give me a sheltered court with crystal soil and I will grow plants for potions. We will use the same seeds you find out in the world.
accepted.body=Here is my conservatory plan. Keep the path beside the crystal beds clear so I can reach each plant and the storage cupboard.
cancel=I need to put this project aside.
building.body=I will keep my things packed until the conservatory is ready. The plot plan lists the materials we need.
cancelled.body=All right. Find me when you are ready to begin again.
back=Understood.
welcome.body=A lovely place to put down roots. Plant alchemical seeds on the crystal soil, then review the planted beds at the storage cupboard. Choose the plants you need and I will tend them during work hours.
how.body=I grow Health, Stamina and Mana plants in my conservatory. Established plants regrow after I harvest them, and I carry each ingredient to local storage. Train my Mastery for stronger plants. Couriers can bring the stored ingredients to your brewers. These beds provide ingredients, not town food support.
gift.confirm=You brought something for me? Let me see.
gift_love=What a thoughtful gift. I have just the place for this.
gift_like=Oh, this will be useful. Thank you.
gift_neutral=Thank you for thinking of me.
gift_dislike=I appreciate the thought, though this is not quite my sort of thing.
building.name=Conservatory
token.name=Conservatory Plot
token.description=Stake a plot for a conservatory.
greeting.0=A little patience makes a very good gardener.
greeting.1=The crystal beds are quiet today. Come, tell me what you need.
greeting.2=Blood rose, azure fern, storm thistle. Each has its own rhythm.
gift_love_birthday=You remembered my birthday! What a thoughtful gift. I have just the place for this.
gift_like_birthday=You remembered my birthday! Oh, this will be useful. Thank you.
gift_neutral_birthday=You remembered my birthday! Thank you for thinking of me.
gift_dislike_birthday=You remembered my birthday! I appreciate the thought, though this is not quite my sort of thing.

reward.25=Good tools make gentle hands. I have shared my tool roll plans with the town. A practiced blacksmith can make one for your gardeners.
reward.50=Your garden deserves more than one good pair of hands. I have shared my tool roll plans with the town. A practiced blacksmith can make more at an anvil.
reward.75=These notes describe how to concentrate the life in three kinds of alchemical plants into a Verdant Catalyst. Your alchemist can teach a skilled brewer to prepare it. The town now knows the recipe.
